Applies to the dataset files under data/ and to taxonomy/taxonomy.json and
taxonomy/label_map.json. Code and documentation stay under the MIT License (../LICENSE).

Source
  CORDIS - EU research projects under Horizon 2020 (2014-2020)
  European Union, CORDIS - https://cordis.europa.eu - CC BY 4.0
  Archive: https://cordis.europa.eu/data/cordis-h2020projects-csv.zip
  SHA-256: d4a8e3645d0b1896b967618e8e7a7f7928738b469737363a30816c217cbd48f2
  Reuse terms: Commission Decision 2011/833/EU on the reuse of Commission documents.

  EuroSciVoc (European Science Vocabulary), Publications Office of the
  European Union, CC BY 4.0. The category paths are taken from euroSciVoc.csv
  in the archive above.

Changes made by the NALTRA authors
  data/raw/cordis_h2020/cordis-h2020projects-csv.zip is the unmodified archive.
  data/processed/cordis_h2020/en      project objectives cleaned, filtered to labels
                                      with enough support, hierarchy-closed and split
                                      into train/validation/test (scripts/prepare_data.py).
  data/processed/cordis_h2020/tr      machine translation of the English splits into
                                      Turkish with Helsinki-NLP/opus-mt-tc-big-en-tr at
                                      e539fc16 (CC BY 4.0). Release 1.1.0: the 598
                                      records the 1.0.0 audit flagged were re-translated
                                      in 128-token chunks; labels are unchanged.
  data/processed/cordis_h2020/code_switch
                                      synthetic English-Turkish code-switched validation
                                      and test sets built from the aligned EN/TR splits.
  data/splits/cordis_h2020            project-level split map.
  data/review                         translation-quality review sample.
  taxonomy/                           EuroSciVoc tree and label map rebuilt from the
                                      archive's category paths.

The European Union does not endorse this work. Translations and code-switched
text are machine-generated and may contain errors.

